flowchart LR
    subgraph Offline[Offline indexing pipeline]
        D[Private PDFs and manuals] --> L[Load and clean text]
        L --> C[Overlapping chunks]
        C --> E[Local sentence embeddings]
        E --> F[(FAISS vector index)]
        C --> M[(Chunk metadata)]
    end

    subgraph Online[Online question-answering pipeline]
        Q[Engineer question] --> QE[Question embedding]
        QE --> F
        F --> R[Top-k relevant chunks]
        M --> R
        R --> P[Grounded prompt]
        P --> G[LLM or retrieval-only response]
        G --> A[Answer with sources]
    end

